s.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zhEjFxwGOtb06NBSTVAliEzVZ0X.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18696","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"178312","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"59113","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"257609","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"451433","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"91172","synopsis":"After a fierce battle with the Corpus, Ten and his group emerge victorious. Returning to Avrion, they throw a party to celebrate Emero's return. While everyone enjoys the festivities, Ten, worried about Arche’s absence due to poor health, goes to visit her—only to discover that she has disappeared. Together with his comrades, Ten desperately searches for her, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lS8J9DOWhvCffsCcPv2gcZEQpVM.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"After a fierce battle with the Corpus, Ten and his group emerge victorious. Returning to Avrion, they throw a party to celebrate Emero's return. While everyone enjoys the festivities, Ten, worried about Arche’s absence due to poor health, goes to visit her—only to discover that she has disappeared. Together with his comrades, Ten desperately searches for her, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lS8J9DOWhvCffsCcPv2gcZEQpVM.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18696","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"178312","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"59113","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"257609","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"451433","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"91445","synopsis":"Receiving a report from Anzar, who has infiltrated Sonrisa and uncovered the guard placements, Nares assigns Ten and the group the mission to defeat L'Oreille. They land in Sonrisa and begin their advance, but while Anzar steps away to scout the enemy, they are ambushed by L'Oreille, Zanas, and Glaza.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qZ7nkCELsnQwHGmXtzz1jCvI3SA.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Receiving a report from Anzar, who has infiltrated Sonrisa and uncovered the guard placements, Nares assigns Ten and the group the mission to defeat L'Oreille. They land in Sonrisa and begin their advance, but while Anzar steps away to scout the enemy, they are ambushed by L'Oreille, Zanas, and Glaza.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qZ7nkCELsnQwHGmXtzz1jCvI3SA.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18696","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"178312","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"59113","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"257609","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"451433","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"91867","synopsis":"On the day of peace negotiations, Nares faces L'Oreille with her army on the continent of. Tension fills the air as Ten and the others quietly observe the two. Declaring no intent to attack, Nares speaks calmly, but L'Oreille, with a sinister smile, unleashes the supposedly undecipherable grand magic, \"Harvest Festival.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3aMMRoik6AF9vWfCwp6Sft7cggE.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"On the day of peace negotiations, Nares faces L'Oreille with her army on the continent of. Tension fills the air as Ten and the others quietly observe the two. Declaring no intent to attack, Nares speaks calmly, but L'Oreille, with a sinister smile, unleashes the supposedly undecipherable grand magic, \"Harvest Festival.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3aMMRoik6AF9vWfCwp6Sft7cggE.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18696","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"178312","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"59113","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"257609","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"451433","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"92161","synopsis":"Nares wakes up in the Magus’s castle, where she is shocked to see the Oración Seis, who were believed to be dead. To her further confusion, Lisan mocks her, and standing before her is the former Magus, Diluculum. Meanwhile, Ten and the others, assaulted by L'Oreille, are swallowed by an impenetrable darkness with no light in sight.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lp85GBjHhF9v0byGcuI9ZIyZNZO.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"Nares wakes up in the Magus’s castle, where she is shocked to see the Oración Seis, who were believed to be dead. To her further confusion, Lisan mocks her, and standing before her is the former Magus, Diluculum. Meanwhile, Ten and the others, assaulted by L'Oreille, are swallowed by an impenetrable darkness with no light in sight.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lp85GBjHhF9v0byGcuI9ZIyZNZO.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18696","scope":"R","episodeNumb